# PART A — PRODUCT DEFINITION AND BOUNDARIES

## 1. Product concept

PrintSwift Local is a map-first local discovery and listing platform initially designed around Churachandpur district, Manipur, India.

The platform allows people to discover and explore:

1. Businesses and shops.
2. Products and catalogues.
3. Services and service providers.
4. Real estate and properties.
5. Sports and recreational venues.
6. Public-interest and community places.

It also provides dedicated workspaces for listing owners, their authorised staff and platform administrators.

The map is the central discovery interface. The application must be designed around the relationship between the map, visible listings, selected listing cards and detailed listing pages.

The product should look like a modern location-discovery platform, not a generic admin dashboard with a map inserted into it.

## 2. Prototype restrictions

This is a private testing application only.

